      "en": "What profit has he who works in that in which he labors?",
      "ko": "일하는 자가 그 수고로 말미암아 무슨 이익이 있으랴",
      "source_text_hash": "c6fc1f1a8826fce6837e0b78a5b39fbab3fc4177f8c377b239f769cf4fda17e9",
