      "en": "Moreover I saw under the sun, in the place of justice, that wickedness was there; and in the place of righteousness, that wickedness was there.",
      "ko": "내가 해 아래서 또 보건대 재판하는 곳에 악이 있고 공의를 행하는 곳에도 악이 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "a36932edb3806fcc193d08c6985e2620a1c0117249849b02479ff1c9e2ede09c",
      "translation_text_hash": "eb838f994c488b3c7f33f5a290695995b91f32c7ece0e5d8145ddd3fb11b2600",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
